1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,977
Your dashboard lights follow a simple colour code. Learn it, and you will know how worried to be.

2
00:00:06,327 --> 00:00:10,693
Red means a serious problem. Pull over safely, and do not keep driving.

3
00:00:11,043 --> 00:00:17,605
The red oil can means low oil pressure. Stop the engine as soon as it is safe. Driving on can wreck it.

4
00:00:17,955 --> 00:00:22,939
The thermometer means the engine is too hot. Pull over, switch off, and let it cool.

5
00:00:23,289 --> 00:00:28,601
Amber or yellow means get it checked soon. Like tyre pressure, ABS, or the engine light.

6
00:00:28,951 --> 00:00:35,451
A steady engine light means get it checked. A flashing one means a serious misfire. Ease off and get help.

7
00:00:35,801 --> 00:00:40,321
Green and blue just tell you something is on, like your lights or high beams.

8
00:00:40,671 --> 00:00:43,655
Red, stop. Amber, check. Green and blue, all good.
